commit ce0480dddee590b6c84c9da5abe7ed8c62ccf895
Author: nocten <kartikchandra804@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 9 22:20:15 2026 +0530

    Port to macOS 12 Monterey (Intel): Node 20 toolchain
    
    Run the agent on Monterey x86_64 where upstream requires macOS 14+.
    Only tool-chain pins change; no runtime behavior changes on other platforms.
    
    - pm/update.py: cap Node lookup at major <= 20 (22+ needs newer libc++)
    - pm/lock.json: pin darwin-x64 Node to v20.19.0 (other targets untouched)
    - package.json, package-lock.json: allow ^20.19.0 in root engines
    - scripts/build/node-deps.mjs: drop hardcoded --engine-strict so the
      npm_config_engine_strict=false escape hatch works (.npmrc forces strict)
    - .gitattributes: merge driver keeps the darwin-x64 pin across rebases
    
    Original work (c) Nous Research, MIT. Port modifications by nocten.

